@startuml
left to right direction

title ContentIQ: Analytics, Reporting & Continuous Retraining Subsystem
header Module Specification 2B

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"
skinparam shadowing true

skinparam actor {
    BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    BorderColor #1F3864
    FontColor #1F3864
    FontStyle bold
}

skinparam rectangle {
    BackgroundColor #F8FAFC
    BorderColor #1F3864
    BorderThickness 1.5
    FontColor #1F3864
    FontStyle bold
}

skinparam usecase {
    BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    BorderColor #1F3864
    FontColor #1E293B
    ArrowColor #1F3864
}

actor "Agency Administrator" as Admin <<Human>>
actor "Agency Client (Observer)" as Client <<Human>>
actor "Celery Background Worker" as Celery <<System>>

rectangle "Analytics, Reporting & Retraining Subsystem" {
    usecase "UC-14: View Executive Analytics Dashboard
(KPI Cards, Platform Distribution, Best Times)" as UC_Dash
    usecase "UC-15: Export Performance Report to Excel (.csv)
(GLS Syllabus Item 7.3)" as UC_Excel
    usecase "UC-16: Print Executive Report (PDF)
(@media print Stylesheet)" as UC_Print
    usecase "UC-12: Ingest Real Post Metrics
(Likes, Comments, Shares, Reach)" as UC_Ingest
    usecase "UC-17: Analyze Comment Sentiment (VADER)
(Compound Polarity -1.0 to +1.0)" as UC_Sentiment
    usecase "UC-18: Forecast 30-Day Follower Growth
(Facebook Prophet 80% Confidence Interval)" as UC_Prophet
    usecase "UC-19: Trigger Continuous Model Retraining
(Empirical Feedback Loop)" as UC_Retrain
}

Admin --> UC_Dash
Admin --> UC_Retrain
Admin --> UC_Excel
Admin --> UC_Print
Admin --> UC_Sentiment
Admin --> UC_Prophet

Client --> UC_Dash #0284C7
Client --> UC_Excel #0284C7
Client --> UC_Print #0284C7
Client --> UC_Prophet #0284C7

Celery --> UC_Ingest #475569

UC_Dash ..> UC_Excel : <<extend>>
UC_Dash ..> UC_Print : <<extend>>
UC_Ingest ..> UC_Dash : <<include>>
UC_Ingest ..> UC_Retrain : <<feeds>>

note right of UC_Retrain
  <b>Continuous Retraining Gate:</b>
  Only accessible to Admin role.
  Requires >= 50 real metric records.
  Re-fits Random Forest model and
  updates active production artifacts.
end note

note bottom of Client
  <b>Client Role (RBAC):</b>
  Read-only analytical access.
  Model retrain button is locked.
end note

@enduml